--- !u!1001 &6124154145038188311
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 9076005389922541720}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2228702324039901831, guid: c37172f986dc5844584b294312417a62,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Modern UIs is a collection of prefabs, scripts, and UI elements designed
        to help creators build clean, modern-looking interfaces and permission systems
        for VRChat worlds.\n\nThis world showcases a selection of features and systems
        included with Modern UIs. Its primary focus is ease of implementation and
        flexibility while maintaining a polished, modern appearance. At the same
        time, it is designed to be intuitive for users, providing a smooth, responsive,
        and satisfying.\n\n<b>Features:</b>\n\u2022 Modular prefabs for fast, flexible
        UI building\n\u2022  Built-in permission systems with support for third-party
        integrations, including:\n    \u2022 VRC Linking\n    \u2022 Disbridge\n   
        \u2022 AccessTXL\n\u2022 Support for VRChat's Creator Economy\n\u2022 Smooth,
        animation-driven transitions and feedback\n\u2022 Designed for clarity, usability,
        and a modern aesthetic\n\u2022 Easy to integrate and customize for different
        world setups\n\n<b>Interested?</b>\nTo acquire Modern UIs, join my Discord
        server under <b>https://discord.drblackrat.xyz</b> and check out the <b>#modern-uis-info</b>
        channel for more information."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
